&lt;li&gt;Lead data conversion projects with Addepar clients to ETL historical portfolio data from their legacy system into Addepar&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritise and context-switch effectively to complete simultaneous projects, seeing each through to the finish line&lt;/li&gt;
