&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In this role, you are tasked with bringing in new business&amp;nbsp;solely through new logo acquisition. This means you are a creative thinker who is confident and self-motivated with an entrepreneurial mindset&amp;nbsp;to spot trends (industry or account specific) which you can translate into a territory plan. You take pride in seeing your hard work pay off when you see the&amp;nbsp;final results.&amp;nbsp;If you want a sales motion that focuses on customer value, translating problems to outcomes, rather than a single solution approach,&amp;nbsp;then&amp;nbsp;AvePoint is the right place for you, we strive in aligning our solutions to tangible ROI across multi cloud, AI technologies, enabling true collaboration without risk and data driven insights.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
