&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Corporate Account Executive, Public Sector, you will be responsible for identifying, developing, and closing new business opportunities across government, healthcare, education, and other public sector organisations. You will manage the full sales cycle while building trusted relationships with procurement, business, and technical stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating, validating, and executing a territory plan that outlines how you will achieve your revenue targets and expand AvePoint&#39;s presence within the public sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving new logo acquisition and developing strategic opportunities within assigned public sector accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building and managing sales opportunities through public procurement frameworks, tenders, direct awards, and partner-led routes to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing complex sales cycles involving multiple stakeholders, including procurement teams, IT leadership, information governance, security, records management, and executive sponsors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positioning AvePoint&#39;s platform solutions to address public sector priorities around digital transformation, cyber resilience, AI adoption, compliance, and modern workplace initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering compelling presentations, workshops, and business value discussions that demonstrate measurable outcomes and return on investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering closely with pre-sales, customer success, marketing, channel partners, and leadership teams to win new business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and maintaining relationships with framework providers, resellers, system integrators, and strategic alliance partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attending virtual and face-to-face meetings, industry events, conferences, and customer engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executing targeted account-based and territory-based campaigns to maximise awareness and pipeline generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining an accurate and current pipeline, forecast, and account strategy within CRM systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OK, I&#39;m interested... is this the job for me?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for people who value agility, passion, accountability, and teamwork; people who bring fresh ideas and want the opportunity to learn, grow, and build a successful career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will focus on winning new business while helping public sector organisations solve complex challenges around collaboration, governance, security, compliance, cloud transformation, and AI readiness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are commercially driven, self-motivated, and strategic in your approach. You understand how public sector organisations buy technology and can identify emerging priorities, funding opportunities, and market trends, translating them into actionable account and territory plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you enjoy consultative selling, building long-term customer relationships, collaborating with partners, and helping organisations achieve meaningful outcomes through technology, then AvePoint is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other qualities you&#39;ll need to be successful include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling software, SaaS, cloud, cybersecurity, information management, or enterprise technology solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling into Public Sector organisations is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of public procurement processes, framework agreements, and tendering environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience engaging with both executive and technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, presentation, and listening skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to generate and close new business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consultative and value-based sales approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple complex opportunities simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience forecasting and managing pipeline in CRM systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with annual contract value (ACV)-based targets and quota attainment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working effectively with channel partners and alliance ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-SB1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak&quot;&gt;Any personal data you share with us during the application process will be processed strictly in compliance with applicable data protection laws and our &lt;a id=&quot;menur12n&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://www.avepoint.com/company/privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Bitwarden is the trusted identity security leader for millions of users worldwide, empowering enterprises, developers, and individuals to securely manage and share sensitive information anywhere. Bitwarden makes it easy for all users to extend robust security across their devices with password management, secrets management, and passwordless and passkey innovations. The company is headquartered in Santa Barbara, California with team members located across the globe. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://bitwarden.com/&quot;&gt;bitwarden.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitwarden truly cares and wants all Bitwarden users to have the best experience while accessing their sensitive information. The Customer Success team helps customers and all users meaningfully engage with Bitwarden products while proactively planning for user growth, service availability, and to ultimately achieve their desired outcome. Team members have excellent product knowledge, superb technical skills, stellar grammar, attention to detail, and the ability to explain complicated things simply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitwarden seeks a server and cloud enthusiast, with experience in both communicating about and deploying these technologies. You will become a Bitwarden product expert and partner with the Customer Engagement Managers to help customers with their initial production deployments post-sales, as well as implement new features as they are released and increase their adoption of the Bitwarden platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is an all-remote team and we’re looking for someone located in the UK.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Functioning as a Subject Matter Expert (SME) for Bitwarden and its suite of services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading technical planning and execution of new deployments, both to establish and adopt best-practices with a focus on large Enterprise engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advising customers on industry best practices for the full stack of Bitwarden&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with customers to solve issues and/or look ahead to identify solutions to situations they may face in the future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing superb guidance and assistance for each customer’s implementation of Bitwarden and general security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a dedicated customer point of contact for named customers through alignment to Customer Engagement Manager resources through the Bitwarden ticketing and email systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in customer quarterly business reviews by assisting in environment audits, best-practices reviews, and positioning new product features relevant to further expansion opportunities and/or increased adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with Engineering and Product associates to triage bug reports and feature requests based on customer need and scale with a focus on large Enterprise deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist training and culture sharing in the Implementation Engineering Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide knowledge sharing among Implementation Engineers within the team and in collaboration with Technical Writing to share best-practices, troubleshooting information, and recommended configurations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and/or assist in internal team projects including customer environment replication for bug investigations, integrations with new third-party tools, and development of automations both for customer use-cases as well as internal team processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Occasionally represent Bitwarden at customer meetings, industry events, or team offsites (some travel may be required).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO BITWARDEN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent English and grammar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving skills (you might not know all the answers but you know how to find and communicate the solutions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for supporting your team members, growing together (technical ability and emotional intelligence), and sharing your knowledge with all&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong sense of empathy and the ability to advocate for others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for helping Bitwarden users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience from a previous technical position (e.g. Systems Engineer, Implementation Engineer, DevOps Engineer, IT Infrastructure Engineer, etc). Equivalent education or demonstrable skills may be accepted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and desire to work remotely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Familiarity with several of the following areas/technologies is preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bitwarden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux, Windows, and macOS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Docker (Swarm Mode), Kubernetes, and Podman&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NFS, SMB/CIFS, and Block storage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bash and PowerShell&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active Directory, LDAP, Google Workspace, Azure Entra ID, Jumpcloud, Cloudflare and Okta&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GCP, AWS, and Azure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Android and iOS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GitHub&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NGINX&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TCP/IP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DNS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HTTP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SMTP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SAML and OpenID Connect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TLS/SSL and PKI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT TO EXPECT IN THE INTERVIEW PROCESS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Screening call with our Recruiting Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with Implementation Engineering Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interviews with Implementation Engineering team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with Chief Customer Officer and Customer Success Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A FEW REASONS TO WORK WITH US&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our user community loves us and we love them. Come to work each day with a sense of purpose as we bring a more secure internet experience to everyone from our friends and family to the world’s largest organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become an expert. You’ll get immersed in the prominent technology markets of security and open source software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are dedicated to building a diverse and talented team. Work remotely with motivated and supportive team members across the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn and grow. Take on new challenges with the support of your team, and join our #growth-club to continue personal and professional development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:280}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;is a global product design and technology company, with a diversified portfolio of 5-star rated lifestyle solutions that positively&amp;nbsp;impact&amp;nbsp;people’s lives in homes around the world. &lt;strong&gt;Powered by two trusted, global brands, Shark and Ninja&lt;/strong&gt;, the company has a proven&amp;nbsp;track record&amp;nbsp;of bringing disruptive innovation to market and developing one consumer product after another has allowed&amp;nbsp;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;to enter multiple product categories, driving significant growth and market share gains. Headquartered in Needham, Massachusetts with more than&amp;nbsp;4,100&amp;nbsp;associates, the company’s products are sold at key retailers, online and offline, and through distributors around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI at SharkNinja &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SharkNinja, we’re building an AI-native culture. We’re not waiting for the future; we’re creating it. Our people are expected to experiment boldly, adopt new tools, and continuously raise what’s possible to create meaningful impact for our consumers. If you believe the best way to do your job hasn’t been invented yet, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SharkNinja is a $6 billion business that has grown over 20% for the last three years, and it still runs with the pace and energy of a start up. We move fast, and we need people who can move with us and pivot quickly as the consumer landscape shifts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are launching our RGM function in EMEA this year and are looking for a change agent to help build it from the ground up. This is a role for someone who loves numbers, loves using AI to work quickly, and has a hustle mindset to get things done with real impact across the business. You will be hands on with margin modelling, will challenge stakeholders with data, and will make calls that matter. You will also need to be a strong communicator who can bring people along with a vision for an AI enabled, data based, ROI focused RGM function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a role for someone who wants to keep the seat warm for a year or two. It is for someone who wants to build something new and leave a lasting impact on the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will help launch and build the EMEA RGM function alongside a team of six, with a focus on Germany and France, reporting to the EMEA RGM Senior Director.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commercial P&amp;amp;L and ROI&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse promotional investment ROI by event, retailer and product, identifying where to reinvest and where to cut&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain margin by mix models to drive bottom line P&amp;amp;L KPIs, including Sales Out, Share, Sell In and Gross Profit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quantify investment trade offs in line with core category strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shift investment allocation to maximise ROI across product, retailer and region mix&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive an ROI mindset through the promotional calendar and investment guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive commercial decision making with data, using AI to speed up the path from analysis to action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stakeholder Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trust across Sales, Marketing, Strategy and Demand Planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with country MDs to deliver ROI and gross margin improvements without compromising sales and share goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and embed pricing guardrails and promotional red lines for investment levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years experience in the consumer industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in P&amp;amp;L from top to bottom, including sales and share, promotional investment, retailer terms, gross margin and mix&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of delivering culture change through high energy, impact focused work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German or French language skills are a plus, English fluent is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on Excel skills and comfort using AI tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to work around 3 days per week in the office (Tuesday to Thursday), with flexibility on other days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preference to be based in Frankfurt or Paris. The role can be done from the UK, but would require travel to Frankfurt and Paris once per month each&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Culture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At SharkNinja, we don’t just raise the bar—we push past it every single day. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Outrageously Extraordinary mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; drives us to tackle the impossible, push boundaries, and deliver results that others only dream of. If you thrive on breaking out of your swim lane, you’ll be right at home.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We offer competitive health insurance, retirement plans, paid time off, employee stock purchase options, wellness programs, SharkNinja product discounts, and more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We empower your personal and professional growth &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;with high impact Learning Programs featuring bold voices redefining what’s possible. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When you join, you’re not just part of a company—you’re part of an outrageously extraordinary community. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;gether, we won’t just launch products—&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;we’ll disrupt entire markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At SharkNinja, Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion are vital to our global success. Valuing each unique voice and blending all of our diverse skills strengthens SharkNinja’s innovation every day. We support ALL associates in bringing their authentic selves to work, making an impact, and having the opportunity for career acceleration. With help from our leadership, associates, and our community, we aim to have equity be a key component of the SharkNinja DNA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Learn more about us:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sharkninja.com/dei&quot;&gt; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/sharkninja/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Life At SharkNinja&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLmRfBxyGu_mKl9SF12lM1NAIx-z07uLNQ&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Outrageously Extraordinary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:336}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
