&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At think-cell, our values are at the heart of everything we do. They guide how we work, collaborate, and create value for our customers. As part of our team, you will embody and help shape the following principles that define us: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
